# Day 02 - Windows Authentication Log Analysis

## Lab Overview

This lab focused on analyzing Windows authentication logs to understand how successful and failed logon attempts are recorded within the Windows Security Log. The objective was to investigate Event IDs 4624 and 4625 and develop a SOC analyst's approach to authentication-related events.

---

## Objectives

* Analyze successful logon events (Event ID 4624)
* Analyze failed logon events (Event ID 4625)
* Understand Windows Logon Types
* Differentiate between normal and suspicious authentication activity
* Practice basic SOC investigation techniques

